  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ニビめいぶつの　あられ。\nポケモン　１ひきの　じょうたいの\nいじょうを　すべて　かいふくする。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "회색시티의 명물인 강정.\n포켓몬 1마리의 상태 이상을\n모두 회복한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "深灰市特產的米果。\n能治癒１隻寶可夢的\n所有異常狀態。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une spécialité d’Argenta.\nSoigne toutes les altérations de statut d’un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eine berühmte Knabberei aus Marmoria City.\nBehebt alle Statusprobleme eines Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tentempié típico de Ciudad Plateada. Cura todos los\nproblemas de estado de un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "I salatini tipici di Plumbeopoli. Curano tutti i problemi\ndi stato di un Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pewter City’s famous crunchy snack. They can be used\nto heal all status conditions of a single Pokémon.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ニビ名物の　あられ。\nポケモン　１匹の　状態の\n異常を　すべて　回復する。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "深灰特产的糕点。\n能治愈１只宝可梦的\n所有异常状态。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
